{"id":"h-0301","domain":"logic gate circuit","names":["InA","InB","AndGate","Out"],"text":"For my logic homework, connect InA to AndGate with a plain arrow, and connect InB to AndGate too. Make AndGate a small orange rectangle. Connect AndGate to Out with a dashed arrow labeled result. Is Out reachable from InA? And how many connections does AndGate have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"InA,InB","to":"AndGate"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"AndGate","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"AndGate","color":"orange"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"AndGate","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"AndGate","to":"Out","style":"dashed","label":"result"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"InA","to":"Out"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"AndGate"}}]}
