{"id":"h-0304","domain":"hurricane evacuation plan","names":["Coast","Inland","Shelter","Zone3"],"text":"Hurricane planning means the shelter has to be farther from the coast, so move Shelter to the right of Inland. Make Zone3 a huge red square to mark the danger area. Which shapes are not red? Could you check whether Zone3 is bigger than Shelter? And who is directly linked to Coast?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Shelter","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Inland"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Zone3","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Zone3","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Zone3","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"red"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Zone3","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Shelter"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"Coast"}}]}
