{"id":"h-0337","domain":"star field rules","names":["Cosmo"],"text":"From now on, new stars should be large so they stand out. Create a star called Nova near Cosmo, and then make Cosmo navy. How many stars are there now? It has to look presentable for the workshop.","wires":[{"type":"rule","args":{"shape":"star","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"star","name":"Nova","position":"near","anchor":"Cosmo"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Cosmo","color":"navy"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","shape":"star"}}]}
{"id":"h-0338","domain":"lab board reset","names":["Lab3"],"text":"Forget everything you learned about the squares, I want a clean start on this lab board. Create a square called Beaker2 next to Lab3. Which shapes are not white right now? I have a long list of other tasks today.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"forget"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"square","name":"Beaker2","position":"near","anchor":"Lab3"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","notColor":"white"}}]}
{"id":"h-0339","domain":"clock face diagram","names":["Clock","Hour","Minute"],"text":"Let's make a clock diagram, so arrange everything in a circle. Make Hour a small black rectangle and Minute a tiny red rectangle. Is Hour bigger than Minute? Which shape is the topmost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"arrange","layout":"circle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Hour","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Hour","color":"black"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Hour","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Minute","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Minute","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Minute","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Hour","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Minute"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"topmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0340","domain":"bookshelf layout","names":["Shelf7","Book1","Book2","Book3"],"text":"Please distribute Book1, Book2 and Book3 along the vertical axis so they look neat on Shelf7. Which book is the bottommost? Also count how many shapes are gray. The old diagram was missing half the parts.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"distribute","target":"Book1,Book2,Book3","axis":"vertical"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"bottommost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"gray"}}]}
{"id":"h-0341","domain":"two people diagram","names":["Ben2","Ann2"],"text":"Align the circles horizontally, the layout is off. Then move Ann2 to the left of Ben2. Which shape is closest to Ben2? And is Ann2 connected to Ben2?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"align","target":"mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)","axis":"horizontal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Ann2","position":"leftOf","anchor":"Ben2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Ben2","superlative":"closest"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Ann2","anchor":"Ben2"}}]}
{"id":"h-0342","domain":"harbor pier diagram","names":["Gate8","Pier"],"text":"Which red shapes are next to Pier? Please connect Gate8 to Pier with a dotted line and move Gate8 below Pier. It is for a presentation to the board next month. We will print a copy for each table.","wires":[{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","color":"red","position":"near","anchor":"Pier"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Gate8","to":"Pier","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Gate8","position":"below","anchor":"Pier"}}]}
{"id":"h-0343","domain":"hidden shape recovery","names":["Badge9","Back9"],"text":"Bring the last shape I made to the front, it is the one that's hidden. Then connect Badge9 to Back9 with an arrow labeled id. How many connections does Badge9 have? We go over the layout with the team tomorrow.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"toFront","target":"mention(recency=newest)"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Badge9","to":"Back9","label":"id"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Badge9"}}]}
{"id":"h-0344","domain":"gem and ruby labels","names":["Gem","Ruby"],"text":"The first star should be labeled Gem, and the newest circle should be labeled Ruby. Then move Ruby to the left of Gem. Which shape is the leftmost one? I will double check everything afterward.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"label","target":"mention(recency=oldest,shape=star)","label":"Gem"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"label","target":"mention(recency=newest,shape=circle)","label":"Ruby"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Ruby","position":"leftOf","anchor":"Gem"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0345","domain":"gear train diagram","names":["Cog","Axle"],"text":"Who is linked to the orange hexagon? Please set Axle to large and connect Cog to Axle with a plain line. We only have one afternoon to finish this. Let me know when it is done so I can review it.","wires":[{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"mention(color=orange,shape=hexagon)"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Axle","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Cog","to":"Axle","arrow":"none"}}]}
{"id":"h-0346","domain":"kitchen appliance layout","names":["Kettle","Stove2","Sink3"],"text":"Is Stove2 bigger than Kettle? If it is not, make Stove2 huge. Then move Sink3 to the right of Kettle. How many shapes are on the page?","wires":[{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Stove2","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Kettle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Stove2","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Sink3","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Kettle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count"}}]}
{"id":"h-0347","domain":"cat daily routine chart","names":["Breakfast","Nap","Play","Dinner"],"text":"My cat schedule chart: put Nap below Breakfast, and Play to the right of Nap. Make Dinner a gold circle. Which activity is the topmost? And how many connections does Breakfast have?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Nap","position":"below","anchor":"Breakfast"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Play","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Nap"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Dinner","color":"gold"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Dinner","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"topmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Breakfast"}}]}
{"id":"h-0348","domain":"ping pong rally diagram","names":["Ping2","Pong2"],"text":"Connect Ping2 to Pong2 with a dotted line labeled volley, and Pong2 to Ping2 with a dashed line labeled return. Is Ping2 connected to Pong2 directly? Make Pong2 a large cyan oval. I keep forgetting the naming convention, so bear with me.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Ping2","to":"Pong2","style":"dotted","label":"volley"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Pong2","to":"Ping2","style":"dashed","label":"return"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Ping2","anchor":"Pong2"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pong2","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pong2","color":"cyan"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pong2","shape":"ellipse"}}]}
{"id":"h-0349","domain":"upper and lower panels","names":["Upper","Lower","Side"],"text":"Upper is above Lower already, I think. Please move Side to the left of Lower. Which shape is the biggest one now? Also set Lower to purple.","wires":[{"type":"fact","args":{"target":"Upper","position":"above","anchor":"Lower"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Side","position":"leftOf","anchor":"Lower"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"biggest"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Lower","color":"purple"}}]}
{"id":"h-0350","domain":"reading corner plan","names":["Rug2","Shelf8","Chair8"],"text":"For our reading corner, please move Chair8 near Shelf8 and make the Rug2 a large yellow square. Is there any blue shape on the map? Also which shape is closest to Rug2? The deadline moved up, so I am rushing a bit.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Chair8","position":"near","anchor":"Shelf8"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rug2","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rug2","color":"yellow"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rug2","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"exists","color":"blue"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Rug2","superlative":"closest"}}]}
